mp":1786912599876,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74yddjEat9k79dHQQYC","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_015WxL2hcUQjLVkytScqBzS9","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"state_name\"\n\"California\"\n\"New York\"\n\"Pennsylvania\"\n\"Minnesota\"\n\"Illinois\"\n\"Virginia\"\n\"Wisconsin\"\n\"Michigan\"\n\"Massachusetts\"\n\"Florida\"\n\"Georgia\"\n\"Ohio\"\n\"Texas\"\n\"Missouri\"\n\"North Carolina\"\n\"Iowa\"\n\"Kentucky\"\n\"Indiana\"\n\"Colorado\"\n\"Washington\"\n\"Maryland\"\n\"Connecticut\"\n\"Kansas\"\n\"Oregon\"\n\"Alabama\"\n\"Oklahoma\"\n\"Arizona\"\n\"Tennessee\"\n\"South Carolina\"\n\"New Jersey\"\n\"Montana\"\n\"Arkansas\"\n\"Louisiana\"\n\"Vermont\"\n\"Alaska\"\n\"Idaho\"\n\"West Virginia\"\n\"Wyoming\"\n\"Nebraska\"\n\"District Of Columbia\"\n\"New Hampshire\"\n\"Mississippi\"\n\"Delaware\"\n\"Maine\"\n\"New Mexico\"\n\"Rhode Island\"\n\"Utah\"\n\"Nevada\"\n\"North Dakota\"\n\"South Dakota\"\n\"Hawaii\"\n\"Puerto Rico\"\n\"Virgin Islands\"\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786912603390},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the data includes:\n- All 50 states\n- District Of Columbia\n- Puerto Rico\n- Virgin Islands\n\nThe territories are typically Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands (and other US territories). The user asked for \"total farmers markets (excl. territories)\" so I should exclude Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands.\n\nLet me calculate:\n1. Sum of farmers_markets where state_name is not in (\"Puerto Rico\", \"Virgin Islands\")\n2. Get the population: 341,784,857\n3. Calculate: (total farmers markets / population) * 100,000","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01KUW2r1WtPtZ7mwtmsZULFL","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.filter((source.state_name != \"Puerto Rico\") & (source.state_name != \"Virgin Islands\")).aggregate(total_markets=source.farmers_markets.sum())"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":270,"cacheRead":17840,"cacheWrite":442,"totalTokens":18565,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.00135,"cacheRead":0.0017840000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.0005525,"total":0.0036995000000000005},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":131},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912603390,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74yttkptEVoC3esYr9r","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01KUW2r1WtPtZ7mwtmsZULFL","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"xorq_select: select: ValueError: disallowed expression: BitAnd (the safe evaluator rejects `&`/`|` — chain filters instead: source.filter(a).filter(b))\n"}],"details":{},"isError":true,"timestamp":1786912607651},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ah, I need to chain the filters instead of using &. Let me fix that.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01APQCNUznLCLeC5eAoHpA59","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.filter(source.state_name != \"Puerto Rico\").filter(source.state_name != \"Virgin Islands\").aggregate(total_markets=source.farmers_markets.sum())"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":14,"output":164,"cacheRead":18282,"cacheWrite":344,"totalTokens":18804,"cost":{"input":0.000014,"output":0.0008200000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0018282,"cacheWrite":0.00043,"total":0.0030922},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":24},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912607651,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74zEqZ7E9eMZPqxJ7ic","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01APQCNUznLCLeC5eAoHpA59","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"total_markets\"\n7942\n\n(showing up to 50 rows; pass limit or aggregate to count — do not page)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786912610813},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! So we have:\n- Total farmers markets (excl. territories): 7,942\n- 2025 US population: 341,784,857\n\nNow I need to calculate: (7,942 / 341,784,857) * 100,000\n\nLet me create a derived metric for this calculation in the catalog to get the exact result.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create a build script to calculate the ratio with both sources."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_015uLjj7vHaM89WzJtygh7Am","name":"write","arguments":{"path":".xorq/scripts/markets_per_100k.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener(); _o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]; u.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\n# Read farmers markets data\nmarkets = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"markets\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Read census data\ncensus = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"census\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Filter out territories and aggregate\nmarkets_total = (\n    markets.filter(markets.state_name != \"Puerto Rico\")\n          .filter(markets.state_name != \"Virgin Islands\")\n          .aggregate(total_markets=markets.farmers_markets.sum())\n          .mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n)\n\n# Get US population\nus_pop = (\n    census.filter(census.NAME == \"United States\")\n          .select(\"POPESTIMATE2025\")\n          .mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n)\n\n# Join and calculate rate\nexpr = (\n    markets_total.join(us_pop, markets_total.k == us_pop.k)\n                 .mutate(markets_per_100k=markets_total.total_markets / us_pop.POPESTIMATE2025 * 100000)\n                 .select(\"total_markets\", \"POPESTIMATE2025\", \"markets_per_100k\")\n)\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":684,"cacheRead":18626,"cacheWrite":212,"totalTokens":19534,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0034200000000000003,"cacheRead":0.0018626,"cacheWrite":0.000265,"total":0.0055596},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":85},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912610813,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74zUycEfeScfr5dJz2o","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_015uLjj7vHaM89WzJtygh7Am","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 1417 bytes to .xorq/scripts/markets_per_100k.py"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786912618208},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me build this script and add it to the catalog.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01RBatfHSSLeeVANnKfprNhv","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/trial-pi-50-w2z1jar8 && xorq build .xorq/scripts/markets_per_100k.py --builds-dir .xorq/builds --emit-build-path-to /tmp/bp_rate.txt 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":141,"cacheRead":18838,"cacheWrite":725,"totalTokens":19717,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.000705,"cacheRead":0.0018838000000000001,"cacheWrite":0.00090625,"total":0.00350805},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":18},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912618209,"responseId":"msg_011Ce7512LWLhYzDsaRWc7AP","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01RBatfHSSLeeVANnKfprNhv","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Building expr from .xorq/scripts/markets_per_100k.py\n/nix/store/yvlv6n4rx6dnnvhi7sgc5lm0152pa8mx-pi-xorq-duel-dev-env/lib/python3.13/site-packages/xorq/ibis_yaml/sql.py:120: UserWarning: <xorq.backends.pandas.Backend object at 0x12c3f7490> is not a SQL backend, so no SQL string will be generated\n  \"sql\": to_sql(expr).strip(),\nWritte